@startuml
title lobster-codebeamer - System Context

actor "Human/CI" as Human
rectangle "lobster-codebeamer" as Tool
cloud "Codebeamer instance\nREST API v3" as Codebeamer
folder "YAML configuration\ncodebeamer-config.yaml" as Config
file "Optional input\nsource.lobster" as Input
file "Output\n<configured .lobster path> \n Default: codebeamer.lobster" as Output
folder "~/.netrc" as Netrc
rectangle "LOBSTER interchange\nand report tools" as LobsterCore
rectangle "Console" as Console

Human --> Tool : CLI
Config --> Tool : YAML\nimport and transport settings
Input --> Tool : .lobster JSON\nunresolved req tags
Netrc --> Tool : login/password\nfallback credentials
Tool --> Codebeamer : HTTPS GET\nREST API v3 + authentication
Codebeamer --> Tool : JSON API pages\nitems / page / total
Tool --> Output : .lobster JSON\nCodebeamer items
Tool --> Console : progress, warnings,\nerrors, exit code
Output --> LobsterCore : .lobster interchange\nJSON artifact

note right of Tool
Single black-box boundary.

Import modes:
1. import_query
   report ID or cbQL
2. import_tagged
   resolve req tags

Read-only extraction:
Codebeamer -> LOBSTER
end note

note right of Codebeamer
Query sources:
- saved report ID
- cbQL query
- IDs from unresolved req references
  in any supported input schema

Response contract:
page, pageSize, total, items
end note

@enduml
